Uncommitted Wine changes on 2026-10-11, saved so they aren't lost; not part of the build's patch series.
Base: the Wine tree with wine-arm64/patches/wine 0001-0027 applied (commit 199cab0 in build/wine-arm64-src/wine).
Apply with: git -C build/wine-arm64-src/wine apply aoe2/wip/wine-uncommitted-20261011.patch
- dlls/ntdll/sync.c: the lost-wakeup fix for patch 0025 (HANDOFF §4 item 6); test in wine-arm64/tests/arm64ec-waitaddr.c.
- dlls/ntdll/unix/loader.c: realpath the loader on macOS, so Wine processes get wine.app's bundle ID (Game Mode).
- dlls/win32u/vulkan.c, dlls/winemac.drv: letterbox experiments (HANDOFF §4 item 1, dropped; not proven).
Not in it: the macOS get_thread_times and ARM64EC NtGetContextThread flag fixes from 2026-10-10 (HANDOFF §4 item 5).

